***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** ClickTake Technologies — production env vars
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to `.env.production` (gitignored) and fill in the values,
***REMOVED*** OR set them directly in the Cloudflare / Vercel dashboards.
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** Every variable below is consumed by code in `src/`. Lines starting with `***REMOVED***`
***REMOVED*** are documentation; uncomment + fill the others.
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

***REMOVED*** ─── Core app ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=production

***REMOVED*** Public Supabase URL + anon key (already in wrangler.toml [vars], re-listed
***REMOVED*** here for Vercel — Vercel doesn't read wrangler.toml).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://crejzifwpcnjqghlbbdf.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=***REDACTED_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY***

***REMOVED*** Cloudinary (public — used by the contact-form uploader)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=dwioesu97
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=contact_uploads

***REMOVED*** Cloudflare Turnstile (bot protection on public forms)
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAADpHuqrF417pgTBa
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=                          ***REMOVED*** server-side — from Cloudflare dashboard

***REMOVED*** ─── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Postgres connection string (Supabase / Neon / RDS / etc.)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db?sslmode=require
DIRECT_URL=                                     ***REMOVED*** same as DATABASE_URL (Supabase direct, no pooler)

***REMOVED*** ─── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** NextAuth reads these automatically — do NOT rename.
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=                                ***REMOVED*** openssl rand -base64 32
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://clicktaketech.com          ***REMOVED*** canonical production URL

***REMOVED*** Super-admin bootstrap (used once on first boot to seed the first admin user)
SUPERADMIN_EMAIL=admin@clicktaketech.com
SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD=                            ***REMOVED*** change after first login

***REMOVED*** Provider credentials encryption key (used to encrypt stored API keys for
***REMOVED*** SMTP / Cloudflare / etc. inside the admin panel). MUST be 64 hex chars.
PROVIDER_CREDENTIALS_ENCRYPTION_KEY=            ***REMOVED*** openssl rand -hex 32

***REMOVED*** ─── Email (SMTP) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MAIL_FROM=ClickTake <noreply@clicktaketech.com>
SMTP_FROM=ClickTake <noreply@clicktaketech.com> ***REMOVED*** alias — code accepts either

***REMOVED*** Where contact-form leads + career applications are sent (defaults to
***REMOVED*** leads@clicktaketech.com / careers@clicktaketech.com if unset).
LEADS_EMAIL=leads@clicktaketech.com
CAREERS_EMAIL=careers@clicktaketech.com
PROVIDER_ALERT_TO=alerts@clicktaketech.com

***REMOVED*** ─── Cron ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Token required to call /api/cron/* endpoints (set in vercel.json + used by
***REMOVED*** Cloudflare cron triggers). Must match the token in the URL.
CRON_SECRET=***REDACTED_CRON_SECRET***

***REMOVED*** ─── Cloudflare Worker only ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** When set, the CF Worker proxies /api/* and /admin/* to this URL.
***REMOVED*** Set this to the Vercel production URL after deploying to Vercel.
***REMOVED*** (Set via: echo "https://clicktake.vercel.app" | bunx wrangler secret put BACKEND_URL)
BACKEND_URL=https://clicktake.vercel.app

***REMOVED*** ─── Optional OAuth providers (uncomment + fill to enable) ───────────────────
***REMOVED*** GITHUB_ID=
***REMOVED*** GITHUB_SECRET=
***REMOVED*** GOOGLE_ID=
***REMOVED*** GOOGLE_SECRET=

***REMOVED*** ─── Optional: provider debug logging ────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** PROVIDER_DEBUG=true
